    /* H57.56BW: BV hardware proved that recomputing tip->closest-point every
       latch-maintenance frame makes the constraint normal jump between adjacent
       collision faces (-X/+Y/+Z/-Y/diagonal).  The exact icon-13 TRUE TOUCH
       frame already captured the correct outward normal immediately before the
       authored latch is established.  Once that same body owns the latch, keep
       the vector fixed and refresh only its age.  This removes a mod-created
       moving constraint plane while preserving the SOLID pair and all native
       switch semantics. */
