// of requiring the owner body to be close in 3D, it decomposes contact distance
// against the authored slider pin: depth ALONG the rail may be large for a closed
// drawer, while perpendicular/lateral distance must stay small. This separates
// stacked drawers much better than a larger spherical radius. After an owner is
