// H43: exact drawer-front projection selector.
//
// H42 made closed drawers reachable by searching a broad neighbourhood for a
// Slider owner, but the 9.5 cm perpendicular gate is necessarily heuristic.
// Two vertically adjacent drawers can both fit inside that gate, so a squeeze
// near the boundary can select the wrong Slider.  H43 keeps H42's native
// CanInteract/OnInteract proof and force-only Slider servo, but replaces the
// ownership decision with an exact collision query: project a line through the
