// wrong assumption: the literal AngelScript declaration "cInput_IsTriggered"
// is not embedded in Soma.exe, so the code-image registration scan correctly
// failed closed on hardware.  H57.40 resolves the live HPL input action instead.
//
// Frictional's official HPL2 input architecture is used ONLY as a structural
// fingerprint: cAction begins with tString, then action ID, cInput*, five bool
// state bytes, a double timer, and a vector of polymorphic sub-actions.  SOMA is
// accepted only if its live memory independently validates that fingerprint for
// BOTH Run and Crouch, with the same cInput owner and real executable sub-action
// vtables.  No field is written during discovery.
