// The queried state remains authored.  We then locate exact tiny SOMA getters
// whose machine code is literally "return *(bool*)(this+0x34)" and hook only
// those byte-identical getters.  The detour reproduces that exact native load for
// every object and returns true additionally only when THIS == the proven Run
